KPIs</a><a href=\"/d/idt4-ai-optimisation/ai-optimisation?refresh=10s&${data_centre:queryparam}&${site_location:queryparam}&${site_ip:queryparam}&${username:queryparam}\" style=\"display:block; padding:10px 12px; margin:6px 0; border-radius:10px; background:#111827; color:#d7dee9; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">AI Optimisation</a><a href=\"/d/idt4-gpu-fpga/gpu-fpga-acceleration?refresh=10s&${data_centre:queryparam}&${site_location:queryparam}&${site_ip:queryparam}&${username:queryparam}\" style=\"display:block; padding:10px 12px; margin:6px 0; border-radius:10px; background:#111827; color:#d7dee9; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">GPU\u2013FPGA Acceleration</a><a href=\"/d/idt4-forecasting/solar-pv-forecasting?refresh=10s&${data_centre:queryparam}&${site_location:queryparam}&${site_ip:queryparam}&${username:queryparam}\" style=\"display:block; padding:10px 12px; margin:6px 0; border-radius:10px; background:#111827; color:#d7dee9; text-decoration:none; font-weight:600;\">Forecasting</a><div style=\"padding:10px 12px; margin:6px 0; border-radius:10px; background:#1f2937; color:#ffffff; font-weight:700;\">Scheduler</div>\n  <div style=\"margin-top:auto; padding-top:16px; color:#93a1b5; font-size:12px; line-height:1.5;\">\n    Use the top selectors to set the active site and the Grafana time picker to change the analysis window.\n  </div>\n</div>",
